assert count_paths([[0, 0, 0], [0, 0, 0]]) == 3
assert count_paths([[0]]) == 1
```

This function uses **dynamic programming** (DP), where `dp[i][j]` represents the number of paths to reach cell `(i, j)` from the start. It works only on right and down moves and avoids blocked cells.

